{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Havendock is a cozy colony sim set in the heart of the ocean, where you\u2019ll build a thriving town from the ground up.\u00a0Welcome new settlers, manage resources, explore new lands, and live your best life. Lead your humble settlement into a high-tech society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/Build_your_haven_on_the_ocean.png?t=1745574821\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/01_build.gif?t=1745574821\" />Create your own character. Collect resources from floating debris. Build facilities to become self-sufficient. Arrange your settlement the way you want and at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/Start_a_farm_and_cook_meals.png?t=1745574821\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/02_farm.gif?t=1745574821\" />Build farms to grow food and cook delicious meals.  Raise and feed animals \u2013 make adorable new friends, some of them will help make your settlement work more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/Manage_other_castaways.png?t=1745574821\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/03_manage.gif?t=1745574821\" />Welcome new survivors \u2013 manage tasks and production to keep everyone happy and healthy. More settlers means more needs to be met, but don't worry. You'll teach your new pals how to work, and they'll help you automate the tasks you like less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/Become_an_inventor.png?t=1745574821\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/04_inventor.gif?t=1745574821\" />Master mad science \u2013 push past the limits of modern engineering and common sense. From basic devices like water distiller or coffee maker to robots that help you further automate your work, power plants, submarine, and even\u2026 a rocket. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/Discover_new_lands.png?t=1745574821\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/05_discover.gif?t=1745574821\" />Build boats and discover islands looming on the horizon.  Jump into your submarine to explore the depths of the ocean, look for ores and oil, or build an underwater farm.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2020710/44716513e94b5294b5bf14ac7d32e8b1f80881f8.jpg"},{"name":"Overcrowding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2020710/b3884ea22f173fcc4cb7323b7e4c668b492c4643.jpg"},{"name":"Robot Overlords","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2020710/c52fee883430f6ac5a7bf3bda0adf6e8a24d48c6.jpg"},{"name":"Researched","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2020710/fb8d2df5cdf69b7a10c9dc7fa508728db66a18ab.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2020710/30cb2e2e9bc43cacf44fb0fde0ef9560bdd868e4.jpg"},{"name":"Trade Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima